Apply the exact gate to ItemChallenge: No unresolved correctness or material ambiguity defect in released items. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
